ion would take damage, split that damage as evenly as possible among all creatures in that Formation; the originally targeted creature receives any remainder.","Rise as One. Die as One.":"RISE AS ONE. DIE AS ONE. - Once a Creature joins a Formation, it is bound to that Formation for as long as it remains in play. Whenever a card joins one of your Formations and makes its size 3 or greater, every creature currently in that Formation permanently gains +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP. If any creature in one of your Formations dies, destroy every other creature in that Formation. Attached Equips leave when their creatures leave."}}},"cards":{"Living Geodes":[{"id":"GEO-001","name":"Pebbleheart Hatchling","type":"Creature","cost":2,"resource":2,"statsText":"Dormant 1/4 - Crack 2 -> Cracked 4/4 - Fold 3","rules":"On play, deal 1 damage to Pebbleheart Hatchling. Crack - Deal 2 damage to an enemy creature.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":1,"hp":4,"crack":2,"crackedStr":4,"crackedHp":4,"fold":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-002","name":"Quartz Bulwark","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"Dormant 1/6 - Crack 2 -> Cracked 3/8 - Fold 3","rules":"Cracked - Taunt.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":1,"hp":6,"crack":2,"crackedStr":3,"crackedHp":8,"fold":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-003","name":"Lava Geode","type":"Creature","cost":3,"resource":1,"statsText":"Dormant 2/5 - Crack 2 -> Cracked 5/5 - Fold 3","rules":"At the end of each round, deal 1 damage to every creature, including Lava Geode.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":2,"hp":5,"crack":2,"crackedStr":5,"crackedHp":5,"fold":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-004","name":"Lumen Nodule","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"Dormant 1/5 - Crack 3 -> Cracked 3/7 - Fold 3","rules":"Crack - Restore 3 HP divided among friendly creatures.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":1,"hp":5,"crack":3,"crackedStr":3,"crackedHp":7,"fold":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-005","name":"Razor Geode","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"Dormant 3/4 - Crack 2 -> Cracked 6/4 - Fold 2","rules":"Cracked - The first time Razor Geode attacks each round, it gains +2 STR for that combat.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":3,"hp":4,"crack":2,"crackedStr":6,"crackedHp":4,"fold":2,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-006","name":"Mirrorstone Egg","type":"Creature","cost":4,"resource":2,"statsText":"Dormant 1/5 - Crack 2 -> Cracked 4/6 - Fold 3","rules":"Crack - Choose an enemy creature; Mirrorstone Egg gains STR equal to that creature's printed STR until end of round, maximum +4 STR.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":1,"hp":5,"crack":2,"crackedStr":4,"crackedHp":6,"fold":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-007","name":"Deepcore Cocoon","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"Dormant 2/7 - Crack 3 -> Cracked 6/8 - Fold 4","rules":"Dormant - Taunt. Crack - Remove 2 damage from Deepcore Cocoon.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":2,"hp":7,"crack":3,"crackedStr":6,"crackedHp":8,"fold":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-008","name":"Gemscale Larva","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":2,"statsText":"Dormant 2/5 - Crack 3 -> Cracked 6/5 - Fold 2","rules":"Crack - If Gemscale Larva has not acted this round, it may immediately take one combat action.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":2,"hp":5,"crack":3,"crackedStr":6,"crackedHp":5,"fold":2,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-009","name":"Stressborn Cluster","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":1,"statsText":"Dormant 0/8 - Crack 3 -> Cracked 7/6 - Fold 3","rules":"The first time each round Stressborn Cluster takes damage from one of your own cards, it gains +2 STR this round. Crack - Draw 1 card.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":0,"hp":8,"crack":3,"crackedStr":7,"crackedHp":6,"fold":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-010","name":"Shard Choir Seed","type":"Creature","cost":5,"resource":2,"statsText":"Dormant 1/6 - Crack 2 -> Cracked 4/6 - Fold 3","rules":"Cracked - The first three times each round another friendly Geode gains Pressure, Shard Choir Seed gains +1 STR this round.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":1,"hp":6,"crack":2,"crackedStr":4,"crackedHp":6,"fold":3,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-011","name":"Crown Geode","type":"Creature","cost":6,"resource":1,"statsText":"Dormant 2/7 - Crack 4 -> Cracked 6/9 - Fold 4","rules":"Crack - Draw 2 cards, then put 1 card from your hand on the bottom of your deck.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":2,"hp":7,"crack":4,"crackedStr":6,"crackedHp":9,"fold":4,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-012","name":"Worldheart Geode","type":"Creature","cost":8,"resource":1,"statsText":"Dormant 3/9 - Crack 4 -> Cracked 8/10 - Fold 5","rules":"At the end of your round, you may deal 1 damage to up to two other friendly Geodes. If at least one of them Cracks from this damage, restore 2 HP to Worldheart Geode.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO","str":3,"hp":9,"crack":4,"crackedStr":8,"crackedHp":10,"fold":5,"legendary":false},{"id":"GEO-013","name":"Controlled Fracture","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Deal 1 damage to up to two different friendly Geodes, one at a time. Each chosen Geode that Cracks from this spell gains +1 STR / +1 maximum and current HP permanently.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO"},{"id":"GEO-014","name":"Tempering Bath","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource":2,"statsText":"-","rules":"Deal 1 damage to a friendly Geode, then restore 4 HP to it. If that damage caused it to Crack, restore 2 additional HP.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO"},{"id":"GEO-015","name":"Resonant Strike","type":"Spell","cost":4,"resource":1,"statsText":"-","rules":"Deal 1 damage to a friendly Geode. It gains +3 STR this round; if it is Cracked after that damage resolves, it gains +5 STR this round instead.","faction":"Living Geodes","code":"GEO"},{"id":"GEO-016","name":"Fault Transfer","type":"Spell","cost":3,"resource